    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101652" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφετερ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make one's own, appropriate, usurp</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐὰν ἑσμοὺς ἀλλοτρίους σφετερίζῃ τις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					843d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πράγματα κατὰ τὴν πόλιν
				ἐσφετέρισαν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				715a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν χόρτον -ίσαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PGen.</u>
					49.15
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἐσφετερισμένης ἀρχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Hann.</u>
					45
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> more freq.
			in 
				Med.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφετερίζομαι</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφετεριξάμενοι</span> (
				Dor.
			
			aor.) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατ ραδέλφειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					38
				</span></i>
			 (anap.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.1.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				32.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τι τῶν ἀλλοτρίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					952a29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι τῶν πέλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.19.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					833.7
				</span></i>
			 (Epist. Hadriani); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.543
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅλον τὸν ἀκροατὴν σφετεριζόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Cal.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				Pass.
			 in same sense, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				10.32
			</span></i>; plpf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσφετέριστο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					50.1
				</span></i>
			: also c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ομένους τῶν κοινῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2.174
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν κτημάτων -ονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					195.17
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>.</div>
